            // #   |           |
            // #   |           |
            // #   |           | <--- `stop_dt_utc` = `stop_dt` if user lives in an area of East longitude (positive shift compared to UTC, Belgium for example)
            // #   |           |
            // #   |           |
            // #   |-----------| <--- `stop_dt` = end of the day for DAY A from user point of view (23:59 in this TZ)
            // #   |===========|===> DAY B
